       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Allergy:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " neomycin may cause cutaneous sensitization (low-grade redness, swelling, dry scaling, itching, or failure to heal); stop if it occurs."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
